# Practice

#### Below are a few examples of AI tools developed specificaly for educational use to support teachers and administrators.

#### Each tool below includes a brief description. Take some time to learn more about these tools to explore the types of support AI tools can provide.

## Educator's Choice

#### Choose one or more of these tools to try out. Try using the tool for a real task—such as drafting a lesson plan, creating an assessment, or writing a parent email.

#### 👉 Click on the logo to go directly to the tool's webpage. Spend as much time exploring as you find helpful.

#### **Note**: These tools vary in cost and access. If one doesn’t meet your needs, try another.


<div style="display: grid; gap:16px; max-width:900px; margin:auto;">

<!-- Row -->
