<div>
<div style="font-size:22px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Khanmigo by Khan Academy</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.5;">
An AI-powered teaching assistant that helps teachers plan lessons, generate resources, and support student learning while encouraging critical thinking rather than providing direct answers.
</div>
</div>

