<div style="font-size:22px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Grammarly</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.5;">
An AI writing assistant that supports educators by improving communication, generating drafts, and providing insights into student writing processes while helping students revise and strengthen their work.
